something that you can rely on

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.200
in your decision making.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.300
Because sometimes
90% is not enough.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.230
You need to be sure.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.850
Luckily, Google
Cloud has a suite

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:22.470
